<title>GREECE: OTE eyes Armenian telecom Armentel bid.</title>
<headline>OTE eyes Armenian telecom Armentel bid.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>OTE telecom's board of directors approved  the proposal of the company's international relations division to  submit an offer to buy 85-100 percent of Armenian telecom Armentel,  OTE said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>OTE's board which convened on Thursday cleared management for a 85  percent stake and alternatively for 100 percent, it said.</p>
<p>OTE shares were trading down 10 drachmas at 6,290 five minutes before  the close on moderate volume.</p>
<p>No further details were available.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
